<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 7.73 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 7.73 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index rose to 7.73 percent in the week ending February 1 from 7.66 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES   Feb 1, 1997  Jan 25, 1997  Feb 3, 1996</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +7.73	   +7.66	   +4.68</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  320.6	   320.3	   297.6</p>
<p>NOTE - All figures are preliminary except for those for week ended February 3, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
